{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation pushed as Gerrit change 1781 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1781), base = current origin/main (post-1771).\n\nWHAT LANDED\n- Terminal fold at archive time: leaf.archive() now calls _terminal_fold() right before writing the ARCHIVED event — reuses compact_cli with --threshold=0 --horizon=0 --skip-sync (gates bypassed via existing flags; ZERO compact_txn.py diff, so no conflict surface with winning-endurant-xenops). No-op guard via compact._foldable_event_count(dir, now, 0)==0 (no empty/duplicate SNAPSHOT on a settled ticket); fold rc!=0 raises CommandError and aborts the archive. Push rides the ARCHIVED event's write_and_push.\n- Active-only scoping: fsck_repair._ticket_dirs(tracker, *, include_archived=False) is the shared iterator; skip only when .archived marker exists AND reducer._api._is_net_archived confirms (marker alone never decides — new _dir_is_archived helper). fsck_scan's four per-ticket checks + _scan thread include_archived; fsck.py parses/strips --include-archived (works with --output json, threaded through --repair's post-scan too); compact.py _scan_snapshot_state now walks via the shared iterator (return contract kept), _compact_all_parse/compact_all_cli thread --include-archived. Usage lines in _cli/help/fsck.txt + compact-all.txt; docs/user-guide.md gained an 'Archived tickets: maintenance scopes to the active store' section.\n\nEVIDENCE\n- RED-first: 7 of 10 new tests failed on unmodified code (archive left log unfolded; walks visited archived dirs; flag unknown → OutputFormatError/exit); tests/unit/test_scan_scoping.py now 10/10 GREEN. Edges covered: stale-marker + reverted-archive (ARCHIVED+REVERT) still visited by default; corrupt event in archived ticket invisible by default / reported (text+JSON, rc 1) with the flag; legacy-archived unfolded ticket selected+folded only by compact-all --include-archived; settled-ticket archive writes no new SNAPSHOT; empty store clean.\n- Manual mutation pass: 9/9 KILLED (marker-only decision, inverted include_archived, terminal fold keeping incremental gates, guard dropped, fold skipped, flag-threading dropped in compact_all_cli and fsck_cli, usage line lost, _scan_snapshot_state ignoring its parameter).\n- Gates: make lint clean (complexity ratchet active=53 new=0 increased=0; raw-git gate clean — no raw git writes added), make typecheck clean (mypy 539 files), adjacent suites 304 passed (-k 'fsck or compact or archive or leaf or scan') + 70 passed in repair-pause/archived-roundtrip/marker suites (the _ticket_dirs monkeypatch sites unaffected).\n\nAwaiting LLM-Review + Verified on 1781; will rebase if xenops lands first (expected non-textual overlap only)."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786725866494812001,"uuid":"2caf8b01-c815-4a99-8016-e24060f06f54"}